        "notes": "• Stock freeze, for a shop that is starting out: count only what's in storage, freeze, and the till sells freely without touching stock or asking\n• Freeze one product (Stock → On hand → Freeze) or the whole shop (Stock → Frozen); new products start frozen until the shop is unfrozen\n• Unfreeze with how many are out for sale now, from the till's Frozen tab or from the cart in the middle of a sale\n• Adjust on a frozen product asks what happened: put out for sale, damaged (out for sale or in storage), or count changed\n• Damage always goes on the damaged list and counts as a loss\n• Deliveries (GRN), stock-takes, returns and conversions still work while frozen\n• Controlled drugs can't be frozen: count them in full"
